Episode three of Lanterns just aired and it finally gives us John Stewart's backstory. I wasn't sure how I felt about a flashback episode set between 2016 and 2026, but this one completely changed my mind. It genuinely feels like they just turned John Stewart into Batman. Check out the full breakdown on the main YouTube channel.

@WarnerBros @hbomax @dcofficial 

#Lanterns #JohnStewart #DCUniverse #GreenLantern #Batman

The new Lanterns series just turned John Stewart into Batman. I wasn't familiar with this side of him from the animated shows, but he's giving off serious Bruce Wayne vibes. If the DCU actually succeeds, seeing John Stewart and Batman go toe to toe is going to be wild because they are so similar. Check out the full breakdown on the main YouTube channel.

@WarnerBros @hbomax @dcofficial 

#Lanterns #JohnStewart #Batman #DCUniverse #DCU

Now that Lanterns Episode 2 has officially introduced alien shapeshifters into the mix, we have to ask a dark question. Did an alien already take Hal Jordan's form, or was that a decoy body we saw? Watch the full episode breakdown on the main channel.

@hbomax @WarnerBros @dcofficial 

#Lanterns #HalJordan #DCU #GreenLantern #ComicBookShows

The Green Lantern ring recharge rule makes zero logical sense once you leave Earth. If Hal Jordan or John Stewart are flying through deep space on a mission, do they just stop mid-flight when the battery hits zero? I break this down further in the full Episode 2 review on the channel.

@WarnerBros @hbomax @dcofficial 

#Lanterns #DCU #GreenLantern #HalJordan #JohnStewart

After watching Lanterns Episode 2, I am officially on the hunt for a Green Lantern power ring. I missed out on the exclusive drops at San Diego Comic-Con, so I am heading up to WB Studios to track one down. Head over to the channel for the full episode breakdown.

@WarnerBros @hbomax @dcofficial 

#Lanterns #DCU #GreenLanternRing #WBStudios #ComicCon

Episode three of Lanterns really shows off how meticulous John Stewart is with his powers. I dove into the comics to understand the difference between him and Hal Jordan, and it all comes down to precision. John thinks of the fine details when he manifests things like a bird or a watch. Head over to the main YouTube channel for the full breakdown.

@hbomax @WarnerBros @dcofficial 

#GreenLantern #JohnStewart #HalJordan #Lanterns #DCU

Netflix completely spoiled us with the binge model. Having to wait week to week for Lanterns on HBO is painful when the story is this packed. But keeping the audience talking every week proves this series is true prestige television. Catch my full spoiler review on the channel.

@hbomax @dcofficial @WarnerBros 

#Lanterns #hbomax  #DCU #GreenLantern #johnstewart

The dynamic with John Stewart's parents in Lanterns is a little psycho, but I kind of get it. As a Black man in America, I understand the representation behind raising him to be completely fearless and strong. But his parents definitely took it to a whole other level to make sure he became a Green Lantern. Catch the full review on the main YouTube channel.

@WarnerBros @dcofficial @hbomax 

#Lanterns #JohnStewart #GreenLantern #DCU #DCStudios

John Stewart is not just an average Green Lantern. The highly sophisticated bird and watch constructs he creates in Episode 2 prove his precision sets him apart. Plus, his constructs remain stable even when he takes the ring off. Check out the full Lanterns review on the channel for more details.

@hbomax @dcofficial @WarnerBros 

#Lanterns #JohnStewart #GreenLantern #DCU #JamesGunn

We desperately need this level of quality for all future DCU projects. If the team behind Lanterns can keep cranking out this type of show and transfer that energy to the movies, the universe is in great hands. I absolutely cannot wait to see what they do with Batman. Catch the full breakdown on the main YouTube channel.

@WarnerBros @hbomax @dcofficial 

#Lanterns #DCU #JamesGunn #Batman #DCStudios

With Barbara Gordon officially confirmed in Lanterns Episode 2, the biggest question is whether Hal Jordan already knows Bruce Wayne. Who else knows Batman in this timeline? Watch the full BE Unconventional HQ video essay for the complete DCU breakdown.

